cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LLM-AVChain"
message: "If you use this repository in research, please cite the repository and the accompanying paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Munoz Sanchez"
    given-names: "David"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  LLM-AVChain is a lifecycle-governed cyber threat intelligence proof-of-concept
  that combines digest-bound evidence, signed validator proposals, consensus,
  endpoint feedback, and bounded local-LLM expansion slices.
keywords:
  - cyber threat intelligence
  - threat lifecycle
  - consensus
  - endpoint security
  - large language models
